NATIONAL
EMBLY
CRET
SUPPLEMENTARY ORDERS OF THE DAY
for the meeting of the National Assembly to be held on Tuesday, the 2nd December,
2025.
LEGIS
LATIVE BUSINESS
4A. MK SYED SAMI UL IIASAN GILANI to move that the Bill to providefor the establishment of the Al-Biruni Intemational University, Islamabad [The Al-Biruni International University, Islamabad B1ll,2025), as reported by the StandingCommittee, be taken into consideration at once.(Amendments entered in a separate list to be moved)48. MK SYED SAMI UL HASAN GILANI to move that the Bill to providefor the establishment of the Al-Biruni Intemational University, Islamabad [The Al-Biruni Intemational University, Isiamabad B111,2025)' be passed'
Islamabad, the
TAHIR HUSSAINSecretary General
2
'd December.2025
TO BE READ AFTER ITEM NO. 4

